      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 34,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Charts begin with each account's available game history. A missing archive is not evidence that no games were played. Only imported competition games count toward qualification. The original spreadsheet's ratings and game counts are not used for scoring."
      },
